cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Fluorescence USAF MTF Analyzer"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-29
authors:
  - family-names: "Karim"
    given-names: "Md. Mobarak"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mobarak-Karim/USAF-MTF-Analyzer"
url: "https://github.com/Mobarak-Karim/USAF-MTF-Analyzer"
abstract: >-
  A Python desktop application for quantitative analysis of fluorescent
  USAF 1951 resolution-target images. The software extracts averaged
  intensity profiles from user-selected bar-pattern regions, calculates
  Michelson contrast transfer, compares horizontal and vertical responses,
  and exports publication-ready scientific figures.
keywords:
  - microscopy
  - fluorescence microscopy
  - USAF 1951
  - resolution
  - contrast transfer function
  - MTF
  - image analysis
  - Python
